# Source masters kept out of public/ on purpose. Anything under public/ is
# deployed and publicly downloadable, so the .mkv/.tif originals of the shipped
# .mp4s and JPGs live here instead: still on disk to re-export from, never
# served. Earlier revisions of these files remain in git history if one is ever
# needed back.
/media-src/
